{"words": [{"text": "صُمٌّۢ", "translation": "Deaf"}, {"text": "بُكْمٌ", "translation": "dumb"}, {"text": "عُمْىٌۭ", "translation": "blind"}, {"text": "فَهُمْ", "translation": "so they"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يَرْجِعُونَ", "translation": "[they] will not return"}], "sahih": "Deaf, dumb and blind - so they will not return [to the right path]."}